Second, I've improved the way your application requests this permission. Previously, the permission was requested when the application first started. I've modified `MainActivity.kt` to request the permission at the moment the user taps the record button. If the permission has already been granted, the recording will start immediately. If not, the user will be prompted to grant permission. This "just-in-time" approach is a better user experience and ensures that the app only asks for permissions when they are absolutely needed.

